# The same taper run backwards transmits the same fraction, mode to mode: the structure is reciprocal.
# Reference: the same propagation stepped independently in NumPy. The pipeline compares it with the upward taper.
title Taper from 3 to 0.5 um over 40 um
reference 2.75
window width=20 length=60
guide straight x=0 width=3 from=0 to=10
guide taper x=0 w0=3 w1=0.5 from=10 to=50
guide straight x=0 width=0.5 from=50 to=60
launch mode x=0 width=3
monitor out z=60 x=0 width=0.5
plane end z=60
expect power out 0.997663821 2e-7
expect total end 0.999997755 2e-7
expect centroid end 0.0000000 2e-6
expect radius end 0.3946137 2e-6
expect neff 2.779526553 2e-8
